<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-N.TRANSVAAL 137-7 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-N.TRANSVAAL 137-7 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</headline>
<dateline>KIMBERLEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal were 137 for seven from 64 overs at tea needing to score 178 to make Griqualand West bat again on the final day of their Supersport Series match in  Kimberley on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Northern Transvaal 363 and 137-7, Griqualand West 541-6 declared.</p>
